Fonts in this directory (Phase 29 task 29.0, Session Planner design system)
============================================================================

- Spectral (spectral-500-normal.woff2, spectral-500-italic.woff2)
  Designed by Production Type. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/Spectral

- IBM Plex Sans (ibm-plex-sans-var.woff2)
  Designed by IBM / Bold Monday. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/IBM+Plex+Sans
  Served here as a single variable-weight woff2 (Google Fonts' own
  distribution for this family covers 400/500/600 with one physical file)
  — style.css declares THREE @font-face blocks (weight 400/500/600) that
  all point at this one file, exactly matching how fonts.googleapis.com
  itself serves it to modern browsers; a browser resolves the requested
  static weight from the file's own weight axis. Not a shortcut or a
  mistake — confirmed by diffing the per-weight URLs Google's own css2 API
  returns to a modern-Chrome user agent.

- IBM Plex Mono (ibm-plex-mono-400.woff2, ibm-plex-mono-500.woff2)
  Designed by IBM / Bold Monday. SIL Open Font License 1.1.
  https://fonts.google.com/specimen/IBM+Plex+Mono
  Distinct physical files per weight (this family is not distributed as
  one shared variable file for these two static weights).

Downloaded directly from fonts.gstatic.com (Google's own font CDN, the
same bytes any Google Fonts CSS `<link>` would eventually serve) rather
than a Google Fonts CDN `<link>`, so review-ui stays self-contained/works
offline. Full OFL 1.1 license text: https://openfontlicense.org/

Subset: Latin only (unicode-range matching the "latin" @font-face block
each family's Google Fonts css2 response emits) — sufficient for this
app's English-only UI copy.
